  "name": "JD Vance",
  "statements": [
    {
      "sid": "s1",
      "text": "I want to be clear. This administration will block such efforts, full stop. We will safeguard American AI and chip technologies from theft and misuse, work with our allies and partners to strengthen and extend these protections,",
      "date": "2025-02-11",
      "context": "Vice President’s Paris AI Action Summit speech, immediately after describing foreign adversaries’ military and surveillance use of stolen AI.",
      "url": "https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/remarks-the-vice-president-the-artificial-intelligence-action-summit-paris-france",
      "source_type": "official_statement",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "exact_normalized_page_text",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "organization_id": "white_house",
        "note": "Official transcript reproduced by the American Presidency Project.",
        "role": "Vice President"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-07",
      "source_text_sha256": "edb1e09d596038e48bf2d7d4f6e1211ec3b8e7e74ccbdd8664f69578a92ad81b"
    },
    {
      "text": "It feels a little bit to me like a bit of a Trojan horse,",
      "date": null,
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/politics/watch-vance-says-americans-should-not-be-scared-of-ai-as-calls-for-limits-grow",
      "source_type": "reported_statement",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "exact_normalized_page_text",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "organization_id": "white_house",
        "basis": "local_span",
        "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-08",
      "source_text_sha256": "037d0a5da21363524a6d7fefe4027dac740fbbe5f2d009ab8829a66b7e142b83",
      "origin": "federal_historical",
      "date_quote": null,
      "research_pass": 4,
      "sid": "s2",
      "added": "2026-11-08",
      "attribution_span_sha256": "1729504f1086e1bbbf655d077f33d54b68ccfaee1d3c363b5f06650e61e6e106"
    },
    {
      "text": "Those data centers are like the gasoline of the technology revolution that we’re going to see over the next 75 years.",
      "date": null,
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://www.rsbnetwork.com/news/vice-president-vance-affirms-that-ai-data-centers-should-supply-their-own-energy/",
      "source_type": "reported_statement",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "exact_normalized_page_text",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "organization_id": "white_house",
        "basis": "local_span",
        "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-08",
      "source_text_sha256": "7432a09da1741ba0a429225bcc45c5171c9e7c47261d3ebc0c54e528b2830df0",
      "origin": "federal_historical",
      "date_quote": null,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "e12cb240e781de1f995d92df7597c9d35c4cee628658568418936c3189dadbe1",
      "research_pass": 7,
      "sid": "s3",
      "added": "2026-11-08"
    },
    {
      "text": "in navigating a battlefield that’s new to us all: a battlefield with AI. We must not outsource matters of life and death to machines. https://t.co/oGOg3sTTRe",
      "date": "2026-05-28",
      "date_quote": "2026-05-28T19:02:28.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/2060074243556000037",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "ed71a7104299f4ea2c70eee1542dba232fe5c7f962a92bbe6812a56dac8e2f76",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "2060074243556000037",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s4",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some of the political bias in AI models is absurd. https://t.co/vekdg7ZBsi",
      "date": "2025-11-18",
      "date_quote": "2025-11-18T22:24:07.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/1990908908605473242",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "6af10a30ea3b317bcc5d1b13dfc742d26f5af3f65fd8bc16fbf339448838eec6",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1990908908605473242",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": false,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s5",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "All of the fear about AI causing mass unemployment serves to distract from the very real threat of continued job loss through dumb trade and",
      "date": "2025-08-03",
      "date_quote": "2025-08-03T21:24:29.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/1952118399406133372",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "51fb76fa37e9b3bc3328a59c18fde8841e385d17e3f2facbc417cc54a0031b62",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1952118399406133372",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s6",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a fake AI-generated clip. I'm not surprised this guy doesn't have the intelligence to recognize this fact, but I wonder if he has the",
      "date": "2025-03-24",
      "date_quote": "2025-03-24T17:22:25.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/1904222280655286776",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "b838e1c75af3fc87a189570f7c461389508c8c652c2bf6f70abb377132fe1992",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1904222280655286776",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s7",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "regulation. \n\nWhen it comes to AI specifically, the risks are 1) overstated or 2) difficult to avoid. One of my very real concerns, for instance,",
      "date": "2025-02-12",
      "date_quote": "2025-02-12T11:39:22.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/1889640434793910659",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "e030b0ea0e378c89c70e839ed01e9aff75eb10ce481c8c6e07e30542ceff6638",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1889640434793910659",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s8",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "meetings with European officials, specifically pushing President Trump’s agenda when it comes to technology and artificial intelligence. As always, honored to serve the American people!",
      "date": "2025-02-11",
      "date_quote": "2025-02-11T23:21:52.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/1889454839177875562",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "d9095fbf65a74680f1d7413fa62b4c556a4973c438cf97255e11088cd239c551",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1889454839177875562",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s9",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "If Vinod really believes AI is as dangerous as a nuclear weapon, why does ChatGPT have such an insane political bias? If you wanted to",
      "date": "2024-03-04",
      "date_quote": "2024-03-04T02:10:23.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/1764473432169693262",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "ecbdef57e7b3a66dcd13ad80ad6a9d83e7bbee8aff71fe2a61fd746bb4ebd17b",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1764473432169693262",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s10",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "are undoubtedly risks related to AI. One of the biggest: \n\nA partisan group of crazy people use AI to infect every part of the information",
      "date": "2024-03-04",
      "date_quote": "2024-03-04T02:02:18.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/1764471399823847525",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "948486941e3de7c13667d23a857bb5ae3211ae5941d12b1354c5c70723667bd9",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1764471399823847525",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s11",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "Smearing Donald Trump with fake AI images is completely unacceptable. I’m not sharing them, but we’re in a new era. Be even more skeptical of",
      "date": "2023-06-08",
      "date_quote": "2023-06-08T16:00:20.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JDVance/status/1666837574722125825",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "JDVance",
        "user_id": "1542228578"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "f5a908625bfc6f51bc025776af93211db5553485348d51286d48c616013e7418",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1666837574722125825",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/jd-vance/vances-unfiltered-err-side-openness-social-media-presence-rcna196772",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "5442d952089bee472b230e6cfba3af230efe8b74c6a13f92d05ee813f6ab0543",
      "sid": "s12",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vice President JD Vance on Super Intelligence companies:\n\n\"I'm a big believer that when you have these companies going around saying AI could do this",
      "date": "2026-10-19",
      "date_quote": "2026-10-19T22:54:40.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/VP/status/2112316529404748042",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "JD Vance",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "VP",
        "user_id": "1879652428490149888",
        "organization_id": "white_house",
