      "sid": "s15",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "VP Vance on AI and the importance of giving workers a voice in their own wealth creation:\n\n\"There has to be a middle way...and part",
      "date": "2026-07-15",
      "date_quote": "2026-07-15T19:31:48.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/VP/status/2077476242635342113",
