    {
      "text": "between the U.S. and Hungary, including in energy, “technology, and AI and manufacturing… the United States and Hungary have been great economic partners.” 🇺🇸🤝🇭🇺 https://t.co/QPnyZaVerX",
      "date": "2026-04-07",
      "date_quote": "2026-04-07T21:12:37.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by JD Vance. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/VP/status/2041625216019792365",
